WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.250
- Why can't we just sanction Sidney Powell

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.930
to stop her from filing
meritless lawsuits?

00:00:04.930 --> 00:00:06.060
That's the question that I've gotten

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:07.580
from so many different people.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:09.430
And the answer is actually yes,

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.110
generally there is a
procedure to sanction lawyers.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:13.360
It's called Rule 11,

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.390
after the Federal Rules of
Civil Procedure Rule 11.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.860
But the problem is it's cumbersome

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.610
and judges, like other lawyers,

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.490
don't like to sanction lawyers.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:23.430
Why, it's the same reason that sharks

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:26.080
don't like to bite other
sharks, professional courtesy,

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:28.720
and also the fear that
if you bite someone else,

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.490
they might bite you eventually.

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:31.780
But as it turns out,

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.130
one defendant is willing
to you go to the mat

00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:35.490
against Sidney Powell.

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:38.900
Lawyers for the city of Detroit
have filed a rule 11 motion

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:40.680
for sanctions against Sidney Powell

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.630
and her team of crack analogists.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:45.100
It might be one step in
getting Sidney Powell

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:47.470
to take a step back
before she files the next

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:48.930
meritless elections lawsuit.

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.280
Please subscribe to the channel.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:52.360
I'm gonna try this out, see
if I can do a "Daily Eagle"

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:56.353
every weekday, and as always,
I'll see you in court.

